iving Rooms","Homes with Pets and Children","Vacation Rentals and Airbnbs","Office Waiting Areas","Furnished Apartment Rentals"],"faqs":[{"q":"Will this fit my specific sofa?","a":"Our covers are designed with high-stretch elastane blends to fit 90% of standard sofa shapes, including T-cushions and leather furniture."},{"q":"How do I measure my sofa?","a":"Measure the total length from the outside of one armrest to the outside of the other. We provide detailed sizing charts to ensure the perfect fit."},{"q":"Is it waterproof?","a":"We offer specific models that are 100% waterproof, while our standard covers are highly water-resistant."},{"q":"How does it stay in place?","a":"Our covers feature an elasticized bottom edge, tying straps, and anti-slip foam rollers that tuck into the seat crevices."}]}],["$L9"],"$La"]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,"$@b"]},null,false,"$@b"]},null,false,null],"$Lc",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$d",["$Le"]],"S":true,"h":null,"s":"$undefined","l":"$undefined","p":"$undefined","d":"$undefined","b":"lr0MI2iZ95fIsor1M7582"}
